[00:00.00]Wow, Grandma! I found a big watermelon!|哇，奶奶！我找到一个大西瓜！
[00:08.64]Yes.|是啊。
[00:10.22]Good job, dear.|真棒，亲爱的。
[00:13.76]There's one here, too.|这里还有一个。
[00:17.52]Wow! And over there!|哇！那边也有！
[00:20.76]Yes. Let's pick a few.|是啊，我们摘几个吧。
[00:24.72]Let me help you. I'll find them for you.|我来帮你，我帮你找。
[00:30.00]Grandma, is this one ripe?|奶奶，这个熟了吗？
[00:33.26]Not yet, dear. Maybe in a few days.|还没呢，亲爱的。也许再过几天。
[00:37.76]What about this one?|那这个呢？
[00:41.32]Hmm, how do you know which ones are ripe?|嗯，你怎么知道哪些熟了呢？
[00:45.88]Listen. Knock like this.|听着。像这样敲一敲。
[00:50.30]Hmm, it sounds deep.|嗯，声音很沉。
[00:53.34]Let me try.|让我试试。
[00:55.96]Like this?|是这样吗？
[00:57.68]Oh, this one sounds different.|哦，这个声音不一样。
[01:03.26]Yes, that's a good one.|对，这个不错。
[01:06.62]Is it ready?|可以摘了吗？
[01:08.40]Yes, we can pick this one.|可以，我们摘这个。
[01:16.38]Wow, it's so big! I'll carry it!|哇，好大呀！我来抱！
[01:20.62]Careful! Let's put it in here.|小心！放这里面吧。
[01:28.68]Okay, slowly.|好，慢慢来。
[01:34.58]We'll leave it here. It'll be nice and cool later.|我们就放这儿，待会儿就凉凉的了。
[01:40.20]Yay, cool!|耶，凉啦！
[01:41.72]Will you cut the watermelon this afternoon?|下午你会切西瓜吗？
[01:47.06]Yes. After your nap, I will.|会的，等你午睡起来就切。
[01:50.16]I can't wait!|我等不及啦！
